    "created_at": "2023-08-24T15:44:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-24T15:44:09Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the reviews! @fantasai I think I addressed all your comments apart from one, commented inline.\r\n\r\n@dbaron you're right about the test. I created https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/41620, but it's still variants on the same theme. If you have suggestions for other tests I'd be happy to add them. I suspect that implementations already looked at the parent, but did have a bug for non-HTML elements.\r\n\r\nPR Preview should now be up-to-date. I'm not sure why it wasn't before.\r\n\r\n@domenic would you mind doing an editorial pass?",
