    "updated_at": "2023-08-24T18:46:50Z",
    "body": "For what it's worth, there are a substantial number of tests in the still-unlanded https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/29820, and there's also a substantial test plan written down in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/25569.  There are also some other tests for the `:dir()` pseudo already in WPT, primarily in `css/selectors/dir-*` that cover various aspects.  Once the full resolution of #3699 is landed in the spec (which this PR is now an initial part of, but which will require an additional PR), I was hoping to try to get that big test PR landed and then try to figure out what else is needed.",
